R1 = Sum(abs(U(obs)-U(calc)))/Sum(abs(U(obs)))     =   0.11362

R2 = Sqrt(Sum((U(obs)-U(calc))**2)/Sum(U(obs)**2)) =   0.10916

S  = Sqrt(Sum((U(obs)-U(calc))**2)/(6*N-NS*M))     =   0.00233

N  = Number of Atoms in Rigid Group                =        24

